<title>NETHERLANDS: EMBA CUTS 1996 LOSS TO 0.4 MLN GUILDERS.</title>
<headline>EMBA CUTS 1996 LOSS TO 0.4 MLN GUILDERS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss				 0.4  vs   1.2</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  nil  vs   nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Property firm NV Emba said it suffered a loss in 1996</p>
<p>because of lower rental income during renovation of its</p>
<p>property. It expects to post a positive result in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
